---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import ObfuscatedEmail from "@/components/ObfuscatedEmail.astro";
import { site } from "@/config/site";
const updated = "6 October 2026";
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy | FlowNexa" description="How FlowNexa handles analytics and the information you send through our forms. Plain language, short.">
  <section class="container-page max-w-3xl pt-12 pb-20 md:pt-16">
    <h1 class="text-4xl">Privacy, in plain language</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Last updated: {updated}</p>

    <div class="prose-fn mt-8">
      <p>
        This site is run by {site.name}. We collect as little as possible. This page explains what we collect, why, and what you can do about it.
      </p>

      <h2>Analytics</h2>
      <p>
        We use <strong>Cloudflare Web Analytics</strong> to count visits and see which pages are useful. It does not use cookies, does not
        fingerprint you and does not track you across other sites. It records things like the page visited, referring site, country
        and browser type in aggregate.
      </p>
      <p>
        If we ever turn on <strong>Google Analytics 4</strong>, it only loads after you click “Allow analytics” in the notice at the bottom of the page.
        It sets cookies to measure visits. If you choose “No thanks”, it never loads. You can reset your choice by clearing this site's data in your browser.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact form and CricNexa waitlist</h2>
      <p>
        When you send the contact form we receive your name, email, chosen topic and message. When you join the CricNexa waitlist we
        receive your email and, if you provide them, your role and organisation. Forms are processed by our host,{" "}
        <strong>Netlify</strong>, and forwarded to our inbox.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>We use contact details only to reply to you and to discuss your project.</li>
        <li>We use waitlist emails only to tell you about CricNexa early access and launch.</li>
        <li>We never sell or share your details for marketing.</li>
        <li>We delete enquiries that don't lead to a project within 12 months, and waitlist emails when CricNexa launches or if you ask.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>WhatsApp and email</h2>
      <p>If you contact us on WhatsApp or by email, those services process your messages under their own privacy policies.</p>

      <h2>Embedded videos</h2>
      <p>Videos on case-study pages only load from YouTube (privacy-enhanced mode) or Vimeo after you press play.</p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        You can ask us what we hold about you, ask us to correct it, or ask us to delete it. Email{" "}
        <ObfuscatedEmail track="privacy_email" /> and we'll respond within 30 days.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
